{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-8394275289263383082"},"published":{"$t":"2013-10-21T15:38:00.000+02:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2013-10-25T16:00:19.255+02:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Informačná tabuľa Modra - Zámčisko"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nDňa 20.10.2013 sme sa zišli na hradisku <a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Z%C3%A1m%C4%8Disko%20-%20Modra\" target=\"_blank\">Zámčisko</a> nad Modrou, aby sme tam spoločne odhalili našu novú informačnú tabuľu. Náš Žrec zrejme deň predtým vykonával náročné obetné obrady, pretože bohovia nám dopriali neuveriteľne pekné jesenné počasie.<br />\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhmQabZKNjEZonfRrvUoDwOeXl1iz4NhTysgho4i8OU4Fkp3NPmxxs6uhQP0Q-LMnOPO6WcWkI2aGIaJtxqZoGpy_bU3XQPLpQdnien5K5tksAM56rBd8D4JFHR4YJoXmXTodHwL63YTv8/s1600/fotka+1.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"239\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhmQabZKNjEZonfRrvUoDwOeXl1iz4NhTysgho4i8OU4Fkp3NPmxxs6uhQP0Q-LMnOPO6WcWkI2aGIaJtxqZoGpy_bU3XQPLpQdnien5K5tksAM56rBd8D4JFHR4YJoXmXTodHwL63YTv8/s320/fotka+1.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">osadenie tabule vykonali zemestnanci mesta Modra</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjh7LRdiozvnQ-pzVpE74yuEk5b9jcAPiRSWULEcyTIt2JCpbckhqOHAQBn73UYy_eNbWZhcvlKkI8liM5BzL_jGxn0C91uEB1TawJQxKLZrRo7fsTCikHXG2DW6jceRxsKQ-XL6AnAkK8/s1600/fotka+4.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"239\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjh7LRdiozvnQ-pzVpE74yuEk5b9jcAPiRSWULEcyTIt2JCpbckhqOHAQBn73UYy_eNbWZhcvlKkI8liM5BzL_jGxn0C91uEB1TawJQxKLZrRo7fsTCikHXG2DW6jceRxsKQ-XL6AnAkK8/s320/fotka+4.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgvU-E9b4PIMqgv1h9rwABqNBRDxtRqh_wSGvr5UdkgaU_0uJxx1Te2NCYnGf_TuDftO8FF8iVtNHuaE2dOv-IWa_h7so9h83OEgzaXHmggrlX0RsQViG8Y_thKeHQ8HAprCGlvlE8wLog/s1600/IMG_3672.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgvU-E9b4PIMqgv1h9rwABqNBRDxtRqh_wSGvr5UdkgaU_0uJxx1Te2NCYnGf_TuDftO8FF8iVtNHuaE2dOv-IWa_h7so9h83OEgzaXHmggrlX0RsQViG8Y_thKeHQ8HAprCGlvlE8wLog/s320/IMG_3672.JPG\" width=\"213\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">tabuľa čaká na odhalenie ...</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtaiwzOuLd_uvj9b-P9Hmzh2Rw9XY9eq6U3uFY7U6MSGa84Ke85OtF-9d1COifDv9XIUKw3cATTZanrikRrrBTL2VBgNdoFQd_9k-3C6Lc27XHcQsvMGfwYx4_Cl1Wi2NmPiv2M5Fdx_g/s1600/1376627_584169504976931_150890106_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtaiwzOuLd_uvj9b-P9Hmzh2Rw9XY9eq6U3uFY7U6MSGa84Ke85OtF-9d1COifDv9XIUKw3cATTZanrikRrrBTL2VBgNdoFQd_9k-3C6Lc27XHcQsvMGfwYx4_Cl1Wi2NmPiv2M5Fdx_g/s320/1376627_584169504976931_150890106_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgY_NWh9BqsUcG6-lx-jdCkRyykL_xh86tOGPwgfZmgVlB27t7OLJi7ctOhRGe4E2D2lQmlAjb_DO7_6fsl2IFLpaFle9IupAHXjXvB1D61xoTx0_oD4UimS0MuobW__prcVz8zhH3AgSE/s1600/Nepomenovany%CC%81.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgY_NWh9BqsUcG6-lx-jdCkRyykL_xh86tOGPwgfZmgVlB27t7OLJi7ctOhRGe4E2D2lQmlAjb_DO7_6fsl2IFLpaFle9IupAHXjXvB1D61xoTx0_oD4UimS0MuobW__prcVz8zhH3AgSE/s320/Nepomenovany%CC%81.jpg\" width=\"207\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFVFtEYILuYKOrlERjFVORHIEr5qlpZ_nsnz2ZI9J15Rickr-E9JjXxaPkJ-Ggx8Si7_UwvRmgHOkP5DUMe8g8tcTNurpjT1kLLmsLfPqwLYUprzycchcpOYHmQisr19-dAorezscPxBk/s1600/Nepomenovany%CC%811.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFVFtEYILuYKOrlERjFVORHIEr5qlpZ_nsnz2ZI9J15Rickr-E9JjXxaPkJ-Ggx8Si7_UwvRmgHOkP5DUMe8g8tcTNurpjT1kLLmsLfPqwLYUprzycchcpOYHmQisr19-dAorezscPxBk/s320/Nepomenovany%CC%811.jpg\" width=\"231\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhmT7uL9c49OCBBucw-YPHwoewc1fK6JRr101CeAaCWoSHcOLHpHbZmP4kx97Uogw80K4mAw6nz7hKT_BcukD2_acjp4KWhqODxWQJ4vF2chd9HMtRAxgsnBHZpaN_GiSrUF_4j3lugWcI/s1600/IMG_3669.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhmT7uL9c49OCBBucw-YPHwoewc1fK6JRr101CeAaCWoSHcOLHpHbZmP4kx97Uogw80K4mAw6nz7hKT_BcukD2_acjp4KWhqODxWQJ4vF2chd9HMtRAxgsnBHZpaN_GiSrUF_4j3lugWcI/s320/IMG_3669.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Zámčisko má od teraz novú informačnú tabuľu</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNašu novú informačnú tabuľu sme tentokrát vytvorili v spolupráci s mestom Modra, ktoré spolu s Bratislavským samosprávnym krajom nielen tabuľu odfinancovalo, ale zabezpečilo &nbsp;aj výrobu a osadenie masívnej drevenej konštrukcie tabule, vďaka čomu sme sa zamerali iba na vytvorenie samotného informačného panelu.&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXojiuai60LXYdOKlmHNhtNLI1owBMRJVBwbIC9whNIOVt53CQrZV5LxnKiETgVnCgRkQO7lpObS1the5Bxq-bG1Cy2ZbXIwgDPjkE8HZlFKr5TMCp_l9uhaN7UsTZFQmjmh4rckBuuJg/s1600/IMG_3688.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgXojiuai60LXYdOKlmHNhtNLI1owBMRJVBwbIC9whNIOVt53CQrZV5LxnKiETgVnCgRkQO7lpObS1the5Bxq-bG1Cy2ZbXIwgDPjkE8HZlFKr5TMCp_l9uhaN7UsTZFQmjmh4rckBuuJg/s320/IMG_3688.JPG\" width=\"213\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Čendo Žrec stojí na okraji hradiska &nbsp;držiac v ruke picí roh plný obetnej medoviny<br />\n&nbsp;a žiada slovanských bohov o ochranu našej novej tabule</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nText tabule sme konzultovali s Dr. Zdenkom Farkašom, ktorý v minulosti na hradisku vykonával výskumy. Zároveň nám na účely tabule poskytol aj obrázky nálezov v kvalitnom rozlíšení. Obrázok hradiska - detail opevnenia - pre nás vytvoril akad. maliar Tomáš Polonský. Všetko ostatné vytvorili členovia nášho Občianskeho združenia Hradiská. Tabuľu sme odhalili a \"pokrstili\" &nbsp;pravou staroslovanskou medovinou zo slovanského picieho rohu.&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAzHYJ-slGujqLFjOc3OMIqLooN0nU5bKDjmUZRdtIcOf2IzfwPzhwN0hgd6bF68TrilMJy6r7PchTdP7eXKr1vImNM6nndWQc76TX0jRE0_d-EDmDSfz71wphdpVSjuOu6ZUQK72SKEQ/s1600/IMG_3760.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAzHYJ-slGujqLFjOc3OMIqLooN0nU5bKDjmUZRdtIcOf2IzfwPzhwN0hgd6bF68TrilMJy6r7PchTdP7eXKr1vImNM6nndWQc76TX0jRE0_d-EDmDSfz71wphdpVSjuOu6ZUQK72SKEQ/s320/IMG_3760.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_fuPCO_y49d2F1bQQWs6euuux4Jw5HVoJJDbg_lRDup48kCInhCwtqtsrbES62SWi3LaoY23wo7lWdGZq7WVJDGBpuJzWRh86cO_lguv28A1QnZ50d14FFsQYzFMC3nkxwYOZBuIr_-U/s1600/IMG_3763.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_fuPCO_y49d2F1bQQWs6euuux4Jw5HVoJJDbg_lRDup48kCInhCwtqtsrbES62SWi3LaoY23wo7lWdGZq7WVJDGBpuJzWRh86cO_lguv28A1QnZ50d14FFsQYzFMC3nkxwYOZBuIr_-U/s320/IMG_3763.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPJqQSbAOKrm08AmdMVaP7cBd5oPsIa65qk2DjUA0XGNdeI3T9HSB7rP9SQg88tJdeoKmDDic7CcaSuYN3MnbMXLyt_r0qEcFbdZ5Irv_fdA3uM8-StIfhYQyqHRcV5MOTEFsX7v5dGlY/s1600/IMG_3782.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPJqQSbAOKrm08AmdMVaP7cBd5oPsIa65qk2DjUA0XGNdeI3T9HSB7rP9SQg88tJdeoKmDDic7CcaSuYN3MnbMXLyt_r0qEcFbdZ5Irv_fdA3uM8-StIfhYQyqHRcV5MOTEFsX7v5dGlY/s320/IMG_3782.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">okrem medoviny nemohla chýbať ani fľaša dobrého modranského ...</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjIJcnj1rJH74Q_v02EmRF6nOLivbep3HrXRp6QRzVyfzmV41rcpj2_puW2hmCZ1Rw8Lew0r62_Mz-e8dRHl4rz6jkx69Sd-R4YmC4fs4Sh6wP4knLfISm0OID6iWcfELd2GLP2tVnMkRo/s1600/IMG_3788.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjIJcnj1rJH74Q_v02EmRF6nOLivbep3HrXRp6QRzVyfzmV41rcpj2_puW2hmCZ1Rw8Lew0r62_Mz-e8dRHl4rz6jkx69Sd-R4YmC4fs4Sh6wP4knLfISm0OID6iWcfELd2GLP2tVnMkRo/s320/IMG_3788.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\